            "text": "<p>XTU is a global smart imaging brand dedicated to helping people capture adventures, explore nature, and protect what matters most.<br/><br/>Rooted in intelligent imaging and smart security technologies, XTU develops innovative camera solutions across three key areas: outdoor adventure, wildlife monitoring, and smart home protection.<br/><br/>From action cameras that record unforgettable journeys, to trail cameras that reveal the wonders of nature, and smart doorbells that enhance home security, XTU empowers people to see more, capture more, and stay connected wherever they are.</p>",
